Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: rv1126-u-boot.dtsi: Zarnitza MTV3 board (RK809-2,
 eMMC-first boot order, SPL nodes)

Shared rv1126-u-boot.dtsi rewritten for the MTV3 board. NOTE: this is the generic include
used by every rv1126 board in this tree; consider moving the MTV3-specific nodes into
arch/arm/dts/rv1126-mtv3.dts.

